{"3671590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hamstar and the village of sun", "steam_appid": 3671590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐹Become a Hamster and Build Your Own Sunflower Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Hamster × Sandbox × Relaxation&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a hamster and transform a quiet mountain peak into a lively sunflower village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the land however you like and enjoy charming visuals, simple controls, and a slow-paced, cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🥬Farm, Cook, Trade, and Relax</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Grow and harvest crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Cook meals and craft useful items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Trade with visitors to collect new resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a pleasant loop of gathering, producing, and designing at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐹Many Hamsters Come to Live in Your Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different breeds, personalities, and appearances—hamsters who visit may decide to settle down in your growing village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome them as new residents and watch the community expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌻Decorate Freely with 1,000+ Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the terrain, guide the water, place buildings, design gardens—your creativity is the only limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create rivers, raised plateaus, winding paths, resting spots, farms, or scenic lookouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your “Hamster Sun-Sun Village” will grow uniquely with every item you place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📖A Small Story Begins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a forgotten mountain peak, a lone hamster quietly tends the soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a tiny visitor falls from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, a gentle new story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Important Notice</i><br><u>Please note that the voice recordings in the Steam version differ from those in the console release.</u><br><u>The Steam version uses voice performances recorded with a different cast.</u></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐹Become a Hamster and Build Your Own Sunflower Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Hamster × Sandbox × Relaxation&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a hamster and transform a quiet mountain peak into a lively sunflower village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the land however you like and enjoy charming visuals, simple controls, and a slow-paced, cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🥬Farm, Cook, Trade, and Relax</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Grow and harvest crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Cook meals and craft useful items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Trade with visitors to collect new resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a pleasant loop of gathering, producing, and designing at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐹Many Hamsters Come to Live in Your Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different breeds, personalities, and appearances—hamsters who visit may decide to settle down in your growing village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome them as new residents and watch the community expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌻Decorate Freely with 1,000+ Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the terrain, guide the water, place buildings, design gardens—your creativity is the only limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create rivers, raised plateaus, winding paths, resting spots, farms, or scenic lookouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your “Hamster Sun-Sun Village” will grow uniquely with every item you place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📖A Small Story Begins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a forgotten mountain peak, a lone hamster quietly tends the soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a tiny visitor falls from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, a gentle new story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Important Notice</i><br><u>Please note that the voice recordings in the Steam version differ from those in the console release.</u><br><u>The Steam version uses voice performances recorded with a different cast.</u></h2>", "short_description": "A relaxing “hamster × sandbox” building game where you restore a quiet mountain peak and build a cozy, sunflower-filled hamster village.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671590/a2cf1b28607750b9e7de766fdc2f3df6678e38ae/header.jpg?t=1773286058", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671590/4f33428a94a7be26ff76b6861b2a1b1625de9627/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773286058", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671590/4f33428a94a7be26ff76b6861b2a1b1625de9627/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773286058", "website": "https://hamster.success-corp.co.jp/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4370 以上 / AMD A10-7850K 以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<